; RFC 5234 ABNF mirror (descriptive, not test-walked — the real byte-level walker is
; ../📡️component.protocol.semio, walked by dsl::walk_protocol) for the SemioGraphMutation op frame.
op-frame    = format tag payload
format      = OCTET                 ; OP_BINARY_FORMAT, currently 1
tag         = OCTET                 ; variant ordinal, 0-10
payload     = *OCTET                ; variant's own argument tail (print_op's args)
